<title>FRANCE: French Jan unemployment rises 15-20,000 -minister.</title>
<headline>French Jan unemployment rises 15-20,000 -minister.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French unemployment rose in January by between 15,000 and 20,000, Labour Minister Jacques Barrot told France Inter radio on Friday.</p>
<p>The minister was speaking ahead of the release at 0745 GMT of precise unemployment data for January by the labour ministry.</p>
<p>&quot;We will see a rise for the month of 15,000 to 20,000,&quot; Barrot said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
